# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# PVS-011 in the spatial shell: the Location cell answers with the
# containing folder; the Name cell still enters the folder.
wait 10
click 190 76
wait 3
menu-pick Kind
wait 3
click 190 76
wait 3
menu-pick Value
wait 3
click 190 76
wait 3
menu-pick Location
wait 3
note sub's Location cell: no new window opens
click 420 118
wait 1
click 420 118
wait 6
expect-windows 1
note sub's Name: its own window opens, spatially
click 100 118
wait 1
click 100 118
wait 6
expect-windows 2
expect-title sub
quit
